Z||000016||DaRkLoRD||07-30-2001||06:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>well Steve all I have to say is you did a good thing! hes gonna thank you some day may take a long time but he will... once he gets help he'll reilize how much you love him. I don't know if I would have the strength to call 911 I would have to though. and I'm sure he and his parents are glad you did</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>umm. I care about him, cause he's a friend (and also my sister's ex-boyfriend...) but I'm not about to tell a guy I love him..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>but I get what you're saying though.. hehe.. thanks.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
