Z||000020||JSocha||07-31-2001||12:43 AM||||Watcha apologizing for.  I understood your comment about my joshing around with Ken (ambulance still isn't here so he must not want me to be Teed off at him  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) before getting to the serious nature of the topic at hand.  Just wanted to let you know I've been in that boat before and those that have to deal with it either directly or indirectly on the sidelines need to take it seriously when called for but at the same time keep their spirits up as well and laught at something, anything so as not to sink themselves.||||reg||1
